## KEY FEATURES

✦ **Multi-Factor Analysis** – Combines engine evaluation, material balance, king safety, pawn structure, and piece activity

✦ **Rating Adjustment** – See how probabilities shift based on player ratings (800-2800 ELO)

✦ **Time Factor Integration** – Account for remaining time and time control in practical winning chances

✦ **Database Statistics** – Access to 5+ million master games for opening and middlegame percentages

✦ **Tablebase Integration** – Perfect accuracy for 7-piece endgames using Syzygy tablebases

✦ **Graphical Display** – Visual probability meter and trend charts

✦ **Batch Processing** – Analyze multiple positions from PGN files

✦ **Position Comparison** – Compare probabilities before and after candidate moves

✦ **Export Reports** – Save analysis as PDF, CSV, or image files

✦ **Customizable Models** – Adjust weighting of different factors for personalized analysis

---

## PROBABILITY FACTORS

The calculator considers these elements when determining win probability:

| Factor | Weight | Description |
|--------|--------|-------------|
| Engine Evaluation | 40% | Centipawn advantage from Stockfish 16 |
| Material Balance | 20% | Piece and pawn count differential |
| King Safety | 10% | Pawn shelter and attacking potential |
| Piece Activity | 10% | Mobility and coordination |
| Pawn Structure | 8% | Weak pawns, isolated/doubled pawns |
| Initiative | 7% | Who has the attacking chances |
| Space Advantage | 5% | Controlled squares and territory |

---

## USE CASES

★ **Game Analysis** – Understand your actual winning chances during post-game review
★ **Opening Selection** – Choose openings with favorable statistical outcomes
★ **Endgame Practice** – Learn when to push for win versus accept draw
★ **Betting/Viewing** – For commentators and enthusiasts analyzing live games
★ **Training** – Develop intuition for evaluating positions without engine
★ **Decision Making** – Know whether to play for win or simplify to draw

